+# Rejected at Step 0: arXiv:1405.5432
+
+Paper: Michael Kiermaier and Reinhard Laue, “Derived and Residual Subspace
+Designs” ([arXiv:1405.5432](https://arxiv.org/abs/1405.5432)).
